{
  "message": "I can help with that. To get started, I need to locate your account. Please provide the email associated with your purchases (or your first and last name plus ZIP code). Also, please share: 1) the order ID(s) for the skateboards you want to return, 2) which items in those orders you want to return, and 3) confirm that the orders have been delivered. For refunds, returns go back to the original payment method or an existing gift card—so a refund to your credit card is fine if that’s what you used. If you don’t have the order ID handy, I can look it up once I locate your account."
}
